.TH QUIPU-ENTITY-REF 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-entity\-ref \- Mint or resolve stable entity references
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu entity\-ref\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Mint or resolve stable entity references
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-entity\-ref\-mint(1)
Mint a typed stable entity reference from a JSON request
.TP
quipu\-entity\-ref\-resolve(1)
Resolve a stable entity reference from a JSON request
.TP
quipu\-entity\-ref\-verify(1)
Verify a current key IRI against its local key triples
.TP
quipu\-entity\-ref\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
